117 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(Refrigeration System Based on Model Selected: For single-stage configurations, the system features either air or water-cooled refrigeration, incorporating a Hermetic compressor from Embraco, Danfoss, or Emerson, or a semi-hermetic compressor from Bitzer, Dorin, or Bock. These compressors operate with the environmentally friendly refrigerant R404A. The system includes essential safety features such as HP/LP cut-off switches, air inlet condensers/temperature protectors, backup fuse protection, expansion valves, and is engineered for continuous and trouble-free operation.)/E(Refrigeration System Based on Model Selected: For single-stage configurations, the system features either air or water-cooled refrigeration, incorporating a Hermetic compressor from Embraco, Danfoss, or Emerson, or a semi-hermetic compressor from Bitzer, Dorin, or Bock. These compressors operate with the environmentally friendly refrigerant R404A. The system includes essential safety features such as HP/LP cut-off switches, air inlet condensers/temperature protectors, backup fuse protection, expansion valves, and is engineered for continuous and trouble-free operation.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

118 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(For double-stage cascade configurations, the system comprises either air or water-cooled refrigeration, equipped with a Hermetic compressor from Embraco or Danfoss, or a semi-hermetic compressor from Bitzer, Dorin, Bock, or Emerson. These compressors utilize environmentally friendly refrigerants R404A and R23. Safety features such as HP/LP cut-off switches, air inlet condensers/temperature protectors, backup fuse protection, expansion valves are included, ensuring continuous and trouble-free operation.)/E(For double-stage cascade configurations, the system comprises either air or water-cooled refrigeration, equipped with a Hermetic compressor from Embraco or Danfoss, or a semi-hermetic compressor from Bitzer, Dorin, Bock, or Emerson. These compressors utilize environmentally friendly refrigerants R404A and R23. Safety features such as HP/LP cut-off switches, air inlet condensers/temperature protectors, backup fuse protection, expansion valves are included, ensuring continuous and trouble-free operation.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

