endobj

125 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Single-stage compressor for temperatures up to -40\260C, and a double-stage compressor for temperatures below -70\260C. We select our compressors from reputable brands like Bitzer, Dorin, Bock, Danfoss, SECOP, or Embraco.)/E(Single-stage compressor for temperatures up to -40\260C, and a double-stage compressor for temperatures below -70\260C. We select our compressors from reputable brands like Bitzer, Dorin, Bock, Danfoss, SECOP, or Embraco.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

126 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Environmentally friendly refrigerants are used, with R404A for single-compressor systems and R404A/R23 for cascade systems.)/E(Environmentally friendly refrigerants are used, with R404A for single-compressor systems and R404A/R23 for cascade systems.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

127 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Safety features include HP/LP cut-off switches, pressure transmitters for continuous monitoring, and suction line temperature sensors for enhanced safety.)/E(Safety features include HP/LP cut-off switches, pressure transmitters for continuous monitoring, and suction line temperature sensors for enhanced safety.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

128 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The system can have a water or air-cooled condenser based on the model. Temperature monitoring and safety limits are integrated into our PLC system for effective control and protection.)/E(The system can have a water or air-cooled condenser based on the model. Temperature monitoring and safety limits are integrated into our PLC system for effective control and protection.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

129 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(The compressor and condenser unit are positioned below the chamber for optimal performance.)/E(The compressor and condenser unit are positioned below the chamber for optimal performance.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

130 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(For condenser cooling, our PLC system monitors the air or water inlet temperature. If it exceeds 26\260C \(water\) or 40\260C \(air\), a safety alarm triggers, and chamber operation stops until the temperature returns to normal, which can be adjusted through HMI and PC software. This setup ensures efficient cooling and temperature control for our thermal cyclic test chamber.)/E(For condenser cooling, our PLC system monitors the air or water inlet temperature. If it exceeds 26\260C \(water\) or 40\260C \(air\), a safety alarm triggers, and chamber operation stops until the temperature returns to normal, which can be adjusted through HMI and PC software. This setup ensures efficient cooling and temperature control for our thermal cyclic test chamber.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

