<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(Control Panel & Wiring: A separate control panel will be provided, attached to the main chamber, which will house the programmer, on/off switches, fuses, contactors, indicating lamps, etc. Channel type wiring will be implemented using suitable copper wires with appropriate current ratings, along with marking ferrules, crimped dowel terminals, elmex connectors, and so on.)/E(Control Panel & Wiring: A separate control panel will be provided, attached to the main chamber, which will house the programmer, on/off switches, fuses, contactors, indicating lamps, etc. Channel type wiring will be implemented using suitable copper wires with appropriate current ratings, along with marking ferrules, crimped dowel terminals, elmex connectors, and so on.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

139 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(The electrical and instrumentation panel will be meticulously wired in compliance with international standards to ensure safety and reliability. Each electrical cable will be tagged with ID numbers, and the corresponding details will be clearly documented in the maintenance manual. Comprehensive circuit diagrams and relevant information will also be included.)/E(The electrical and instrumentation panel will be meticulously wired in compliance with international standards to ensure safety and reliability. Each electrical cable will be tagged with ID numbers, and the corresponding details will be clearly documented in the maintenance manual. Comprehensive circuit diagrams and relevant information will also be included.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

140 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(To facilitate accurate and efficient design, we utilize SolidWorks 3D software for developing our drawings. This advanced software enables us to create detailed structural and electrical drawings that adhere to industry standards and specifications. By utilizing SolidWorks, we can ensure precise and comprehensive documentation of the electrical components and wiring layout of the Thermal cyclic test chamber.)/E(To facilitate accurate and efficient design, we utilize SolidWorks 3D software for developing our drawings. This advanced software enables us to create detailed structural and electrical drawings that adhere to industry standards and specifications. By utilizing SolidWorks, we can ensure precise and comprehensive documentation of the electrical components and wiring layout of the Thermal cyclic test chamber.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

141 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(Furthermore, we take pride in mentioning that our standard test chamber has been certified by TUV and carries the CE mark. This certification validates that our Stand test chamber only complies with the essential health, safety, and environmental protection requirements of the European Union. It serves as a testament to our commitment to providing high-quality, safe, and reliable equipment.)/E(Furthermore, we take pride in mentioning that our standard test chamber has been certified by TUV and carries the CE mark. This certification validates that our Stand test chamber only complies with the essential health, safety, and environmental protection requirements of the European Union. It serves as a testament to our commitment to providing high-quality, safe, and reliable equipment.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
