<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The PLC will gather data from pressure sensors to monitor the pressure levels within the system and trigger appropriate actions based on predefined thresholds.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

189 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Valves: )/Pg 16 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

190 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The PLC will control various valves in the system, such as expansion valves, solenoid valves, and safety valves, to regulate the flow of refrigerant and other fluids.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

191 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Heater: )/Pg 16 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

192 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The PLC will control the operation of the heater, ensuring accurate and consistent heating as per the desired temperature profile.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

193 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Circulation Fan / Blower: )/Pg 16 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

194 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 345 0 R/ActualText(The PLC will regulate the speed and operation of the circulation fan or blower to maintain proper air circulation and temperature uniformity within the chamber.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

195 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 346 0 R/ActualText(Over current / over temperature protection: The PLC will incorporate protective measures, such as overcurrent and over temperature protection, to safeguard all the above components from potential damage or malfunctions.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

196 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 347 0 R/ActualText(By centralizing the control of these critical components, the PLC ensures efficient and reliable operation of the thermal cyclic test chamber while maintaining safety and accuracy in temperature control.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

