endobj

213 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The chamber is equipped with a feature to retain the system profile and program in the event of a power outage. Upon power restoration, the chamber seamlessly resumes operation from the exact point where it left off, ensuring uninterrupted continuity of operation. This feature is integral to our system, providing enhanced reliability and convenience for users.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

