<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Data Storage and Profile Creation The Table Top Climatic Test Chamber boasts extensive data storage capabilities, allowing for the retention of test data for up to 100 days. Additionally, users have the ability to create and save up to 100 test profiles, streamlining the setup process and facilitating efficient testing procedures.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[9]>>
