232 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Certainly, our HMI provides comprehensive access level password protection. End-users will have their login IDs with customizable permissions based on different levels. The system allows for the creation of up to 12 levels of passwords, each with its specific permissions.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Furthermore, users with appropriate access levels can edit high/low alarm limits directly through the HMI interface. This functionality ensures that users can tailor alarm settings to their specific requirements without compromising security or ease of use.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

